{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mm2/Little-CMS/compare/master...ba0c2b4f92872b914d4e9036f123a50063f58c89","html_url":"https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/compare/master...ba0c2b4f92872b914d4e9036f123a50063f58c89","permalink_url":"https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/compare/mm2:914ab50...mm2:ba0c2b4","diff_url":"https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/compare/master...ba0c2b4f92872b914d4e9036f123a50063f58c89.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/compare/master...ba0c2b4f92872b914d4e9036f123a50063f58c89.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"914ab50e951debe896bd43510515cbd9be6bfff9","node_id":"C_kwDOAAfAQdoAKDkxNGFiNTBlOTUxZGViZTg5NmJkNDM1MTA1MTVjYmQ5YmU2YmZmZjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Marti Maria","email":"marti.maria@littlecms.com","date":"2026-11-18T09:25:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"Marti Maria","email":"marti.maria@littlecms.com","date":"2026-11-18T09:25:42Z"},"message":"Fix GCC -Wtype-limits warning in _cmsWriteWCharArray\n\nFix GCC `-Wtype-limits` warning in `_cmsWriteWCharArray`\n\nThe compiler emits a warning because it evaluates the comparison against the range of `wchar_t`, even though the enclosing `sizeof(wchar_t) == 4` condition makes this branch unreachable on 16-bit platforms.\n\nReplace the comparison with an equivalent bitmask check to avoid the warning without changing the behavior.","tree":{"sha":"750c099fd98c150ccbeab4f8e15d19e6f4a40212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mm2/Little-CMS/git/trees/750c099fd98c150ccbeab4f8e15d19e6f4a40212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mm2/Little-CMS/git/commits/914ab50e951debe896bd43510515cbd9be6bfff9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mm2/Little-CMS/commits/914ab50e951debe896bd43510515cbd9be6bfff9","html_url":"https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/commit/914ab50e951debe896bd43510515cbd9be6bfff9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mm2/Little-CMS/commits/914ab50e951debe896bd4